# ATLAS Creative Hub — Supabase configuration (copy to .env.local and fill in).
# .env.local is git-ignored. The two NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are safe in the
# browser (RLS protects the data). NEVER put the service_role key here or in any
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* var — it bypasses RLS and is for server/CLI scripts only.
#
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard -> Project baswqkhufaoshsxbicct -> Settings -> API
#
# Cloud sync is OPTIONAL. With these unset, the app runs fully local-first on
# IndexedDB exactly as before.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
